  "ingredients": [
    "2 russet potatoes, peeled",
    "3 tablespoons clarified butter",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper, or to taste",
    "1 pinch paprika, or to taste",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/34gNyFgjcqbkEDvvtwrSiBFkTp8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220520_ClassicHashbrowns-ddmfs_4x3_Step_1_073-1-a2588f171e364332ab9bb3d5b20079af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220520/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shred potatoes into a large bowl filled with cold water. Stir until water is cloudy; drain and cover potatoes again with fresh cold water. Stir again to dissolve excess starch. Drain potatoes well, pat dry with paper towels, and squeeze out any excess moisture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/znibJfVjApqNEuCUmKW7UCyMYic=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220520_ClassicHashbrowns-ddmfs_4x3_Step_3_078-1-852219abd03a41c1be22b24feaf571df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220520/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat clarified butter in a large nonstick pan over medium heat. Sprinkle shredded potatoes into hot butter in an even layer; season with cayenne pepper, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pjosLUCpD24y5gW1xMTcBAbc6nc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220520_ClassicHashbrowns-ddmfs_4x3_Step_4_081-1-42c15a19cd684f1c9ee9d25d27026789.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220520/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook potatoes until a brown crust forms on the bottom, about 5 minutes. Flip or stir and continue to cook until potatoes are browned and crusty all over, about 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NrHM96BOBxcbIxWRHrwJIyM6tm0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220520_ClassicHashbrowns-ddmfs_4x3_Step_5_082-1-32c159341c9342c4b01d03b2fb4bc54b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220520/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9vdcj90wdyoowXBrEHdV8wLXEpw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220520_ClassicHashbrowns-ddmfs_4x3_126-bf90488205684501bbf3589b7caf9632.jpg"
