    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make classic hash browns, a simple and delicious breakfast. This stovetop recipe starts by peeling and grating potatoes into cold water. After rinsing off the starch, drain the excess water and make sure the potatoes are as dry as possible. Once they’ve been added to a buttered pan, let them cook until brown and crusty. Hash browns are incredibly easy-to-make and with a buttery taste and a crisp texture, you’ll want to cook them every morning!",
